<title>ITALY: Dutch call IGC conclave for April 6-7.</title>
<headline>Dutch call IGC conclave for April 6-7.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Foreign Minister Hans van Mierlo said on Tuesday he would call together his colleagues for a conclave on the inter-governmental conference on April 6 and 7.</p>
<p>The meeting would be held in Noordwijk, the Netherlands, immediately following the informal finance ministers' meeting that begins on April 4.</p>
<p>Diplomats said the extra meeting had been called to maintain pressure on European Union states to wrap up the IGC by the Amsterdam European Council.</p>
<p>They said Tuesday's meeting in Rome has been too rushed for much progress to be made.</p>
</text>
